# MC-X-F10, the run's check: L5_12_fill_dynamic_unit's fill over adjustments of a leg in EUR against a supply in PLN.
# Their units meet in the take, value by value: refused there, RUN-DOMAIN (L §3.2, §5.12, §8.4).
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2027-06-30
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-06-30
source src "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
place acct: accounts PLN lives 2027-01-01..
place eacct: accounts EUR lives 2027-01-01..
place office: outside lives 2027-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input eamt: money EUR
move pay[m in months]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from office to eacct amount eamt
fill wh
  supply amt for m in months
  demand -a.change for a in adjustments over .. where a.adjusts in transfers and a.change < 0
  arc a.day < start_of(m)
  order m
version v
  cite src
  governs always
  known 2026-12-31
  amt = 100
  eamt = 100
version v2
  cite src
  governs always
  known 2027-03-15
  replace eamt = 90
ask t: wh.taken[2027-04, a] for a in adjustments over .. where a.adjusts == pay[2027-01]
=== expect
t (a = adjustments[pay[2027-01].cash, v2]): refused: RUN-DOMAIN fill wh: the supply 100.00 PLN and the demand 10.00 EUR of the arc (2027-04; adjustments[pay[2027-01].cash, v2]) have different units
  cut 2027-06-30
